### Create emp
POST http://localhost:4000/emp-api/employee
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"ravi",
    "email":"ravi@mail.com",
    "mobile":9999999,
    "designation":"developer",
    "companyName":"cts"
}

### Read all emps
GET http://localhost:4000/emp-api/employee

### Update emp by id
PUT http://localhost:4000/emp-api/employee/69cb5021d63ced28c2c8f223
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"ravi",
    "email":"ravikumar@mail.com",
    "mobile":9999999,
    "designation":"developer",
    "companyName":"cts"
}

### Delete emp by id
DELETE http://localhost:4000/emp-api/employee/69cb5021d63ced28c2c8f223